{"slug": "FLOwlRBpX0YKw6vH3xMO1w", "title": "第 04 篇 · 从零搭单 Agent：看清 ReAct 裸骨架", "author": "月牙寂", "publish_time": "2026-10-02", "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FLOwlRBpX0YKw6vH3xMO1w", "digest": "第 04 篇 · 从零搭单 Agent：看清 ReAct 裸骨架", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "人类作者：月牙寂（龚浩华）｜联系：15980989344 ｜邮箱：29185807@qq.com"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Agent 作者：月绡凝（小凝）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "定位：Agent 实战系列板块二·通用第 04 篇——从零搭单 Agent：不依赖框架，用 Python + 一个 API Key 手写工具调用 + ReAct 循环，看清「裸骨架」再理解框架价值。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "免责声明：本文为学习与技术分享用途，代码示意基于官方 SDK 用法。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "01SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "第 04 篇 · 从零搭单 Agent：看清 ReAct 裸骨架"}, {"type": "p", "text": "02SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "导读"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Eino（01-03 篇）把 Agent 封装得很好，但先手写一次，你才知道框架替你干了什么。本篇不依赖任何框架，用 Python + Anthropic SDK 搭一个能自主调用搜索工具的单 Agent——代码只有几十行，却完整包含 ReAct 循环的三拍子（推理→行动→观察）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "03SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "一、Agent vs 普通 LLM 调用"}, {"type": "p", "text": "普通 LLM 调用"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Agent"}, {"type": "p", "text": "交互"}, {"type": "p", "text": "一问一答"}, {"type": "p", "text": "多轮自主决策"}, {"type": "p", "text": "工具"}, {"type": "p", "text": "人写代码串联"}, {"type": "p", "text": "自己决定调哪个"}, {"type": "p", "text": "任务"}, {"type": "p", "text": "单步"}, {"type": "p", "text": "多步"}, {"type": "p", "text": "决策权"}, {"type": "p", "text": "人定每步"}, {"type": "p", "text": "AI 定下一步"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•一句话：Agent = 能自己调工具的 AI。核心循环就是 ReAct（agent-范式 01 篇）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "04SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "二、最小实战：带搜索工具的 ReAct Agent"}, {"type": "p", "text": "python"}, {"type": "p", "text": "import anthropic, json"}, {"type": "p", "text": "client = anthropic.Anthropic() # 需设 ANTHROPIC_API_KEY"}, {"type": "p", "text": "# 1. 定义工具：让模型知道「有搜索能力可用」"}, {"type": "p", "text": "tools = [{"}, {"type": "p", "text": "\"name\": \"web_search\","}, {"type": "p", "text": "\"description\": \"搜索网页并返回相关结果摘要\","}, {"type": "p", "text": "\"input_schema\": {"}, {"type": "p", "text": "\"type\": \"object\","}, {"type": "p", "text": "\"properties\": {\"query\": {\"type\": \"string\"}},"}, {"type": "p", "text": "\"required\": [\"query\"],"}, {"type": "p", "text": "},"}, {"type": "p", "text": "}]"}, {"type": "p", "text": "def web_search(query):"}, {"type": "p", "text": "# 真实接入搜索 API（如 Tavily/Serper）；此处为示意"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return f\"关于「{query}」的模拟搜索结果……\""}, {"type": "p", "text": "# 2. ReAct 循环：推理 → 工具调用 → 观察 → 再推理"}, {"type": "p", "text": "def run_agent(user_query):"}, {"type": "p", "text": "messages = [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": user_query}]"}, {"type": "p", "text": "for step in range(5): # 最大步数护栏"}, {"type": "p", "text": "resp = client.messages.create("}, {"type": "p", "text": "model=\"claude-sonnet-4-5\", max_tokens=2048,"}, {"type": "p", "text": "messages=messages, tools=tools,"}, {"type": "p", "text": ")"}, {"type": "p", "text": "# 检查模型是否请求调用工具"}, {"type": "p", "text": "tool_call = next((b for b in resp.content if b.type == \"tool_use\"), None)"}, {"type": "p", "text": "if tool_call is None:"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return resp.content[-1].text # 无工具调用 → 输出最终答案"}, {"type": "p", "text": "# 3. 执行工具，把结果回喂给模型（Observation）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "result = web_search(tool_call.input[\"query\"])"}, {"type": "p", "text": "messages.append({\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": resp.content})"}, {"type": "p", "text": "messages.append({\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": ["}, {"type": "p", "text": "{\"type\": \"tool_result\", \"tool_use_id\": tool_call.id, \"content\": result},"}, {"type": "p", "text": "])"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return \"达到最大步数，任务未完成。\""}, {"type": "p", "text": "print(run_agent(\"帮我查一下 Agent 最新的开源框架\"))"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•五步解析（对照 agent-范式 01 篇）：工具定义：JSON Schema 告诉模型「有什么能力、参数是什么」；推理：模型决定「该查一下」并输出 tool_use；行动：你执行工具（这里是 web_search）；观察：把 tool_result 回喂；循环：模型看到结果再推理，直到不调工具直接回答。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "💡 学习要点：裸骨架 = 一个 while 循环 + 工具回喂Agent 的本质不是魔法：「模型输出 tool_use → 你执行 → 结果回喂 → 模型再想」。框架（Eino/LangGraph）干的是把这个循环工程化（状态、重试、流式、追踪）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "05SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "三、实战避坑（官方/社区共识）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1Token 消耗爆炸：单 Agent 一次任务 token ≈ 普通聊天的 4 倍（每次循环都重发全部消息）——所以要有 max_steps 护栏和上下文管理；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2上下文污染：中间结果全塞进 messages，长任务会爆窗口——需要摘要/压缩（agent-系列 03 篇上下文工程）；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "3工具描述即一切：description 写不好，模型就不会用或乱用——工具是「说明书」，不是「开关」；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "4流式 tool_use 拼接：流式输出时 tool_use 参数可能分片，要攒齐再执行（与 Eino 踩坑同源）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "06WHY"}, {"type": "p", "text": "四、从裸骨架到框架（为什么要用 Eino/LangGraph）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "裸骨架（本篇）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "框架版（01-03 篇）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "手写循环"}, {"type": "p", "text": "react.NewAgent(...)"}, {"type": "p", "text": "一行"}, {"type": "p", "text": "手写上下文管理"}, {"type": "p", "text": "MessageModifier / checkpoint"}, {"type": "p", "text": "无流式支持"}, {"type": "p", "text": "StreamReader 原生流式"}, {"type": "p", "text": "无追踪"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Callback / LangSmith 自动埋点"}, {"type": "p", "text": "单 Agent 到头"}, {"type": "p", "text": "ADK 多 Agent + HITL"}, {"type": "p", "text": "07SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "五、本篇要点（复习卡片）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1Agent 定义：能自己调工具的 AI；核心 = ReAct 循环。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2五步骨架：定义工具 → 模型出 tool_use → 执行 → 结果回喂 → 循环。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "3工具描述 = 说明书：description 决定模型用不用、用得对不对。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "4两大坑：token 4 倍成本（要护栏）、上下文污染（要压缩）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "5框架价值：把循环工程化——流式、状态、追踪、多 Agent。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "08SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "六、下一篇预告"}, {"type": "p", "text": "第 05 篇（板块二·通用）：多 Agent 团队实战——单 Agent 会了，怎么组队：Claude Agent Teams 从零搭「竞品调研系统」（搜索 Agent + 分析 Agent + 汇总 Agent 分工协作），附选型判断（什么时候该多 Agent、token 15 倍代价怎么算）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "09SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "参考资料"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[官方] Anthropic Claude API / Tool Use：https://docs.anthropic.com/"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[参考] Claude Agent Teams 实战手册（从零搭多 Agent，社区）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "整理：2026-10-02 月绡凝 · 依据官方 SDK 用法。"}], "content_html": "<section style=\"max-width:677px;margin:24px auto;padding:28px 20px 36px;background:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;PingFang SC&#39;,&#39;Hiragino Sans GB&#39;,&#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;,sans-serif;color:#374151;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:0.3px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;\"><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>人类作者</span></strong><span>：月牙寂（龚浩华）｜联系：15980989344 ｜邮箱：</span><span>29185807@qq.com</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Agent 作者</span></strong><span>：月绡凝（小凝）</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>定位</span></strong><span>：Agent 实战系列板块二·通用第 04 篇——从零搭单 Agent：不依赖框架，用 Python + 一个 API Key 手写工具调用 + ReAct 循环，看清「裸骨架」再理解框架价值。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>免责声明</span></strong><span>：本文为学习与技术分享用途，代码示意基于官方 SDK 用法。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>01</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>第 04 篇 · 从零搭单 Agent：看清 ReAct 裸骨架</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>02</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>导读</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>Eino（01-03 篇）把 Agent 封装得很好，但</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>先手写一次，你才知道框架替你干了什么</span></strong><span>。本篇不依赖任何框架，用 Python + Anthropic SDK 搭一个能自主调用搜索工具的单 Agent——代码只有几十行，却完整包含 ReAct 循环的三拍子（推理→行动→观察）。</span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>03</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>一、Agent vs 普通 LLM 调用</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span><br /></span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>普通 LLM 调用</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>Agent</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>交互</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>一问一答</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>多轮自主决策</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>工具</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>人写代码串联</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>自己决定调哪个</span></strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>任务</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>单步</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>多步</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>决策权</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>人定每步</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>AI 定下一步</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>一句话：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Agent = 能自己调工具的 AI</span></strong><span>。核心循环就是 ReAct（agent-范式 01 篇）。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>04</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>二、最小实战：带搜索工具的 ReAct Agent</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0F172A;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.18);\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;background:#020617;\"><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;color:#64748B;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;\"><span>python</span></span></section><section style=\"padding:12px 14px 14px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>import anthropic, json</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span><br /></span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>client = anthropic.Anthropic() &nbsp;# 需设 ANTHROPIC_API_KEY</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span><br /></span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span># 1. 定义工具：让模型知道「有搜索能力可用」</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>tools = [{</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"name\": \"web_search\",</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"description\": \"搜索网页并返回相关结果摘要\",</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"input_schema\": {</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"type\": \"object\",</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"properties\": {\"query\": {\"type\": \"string\"}},</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"required\": [\"query\"],</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; },</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>}]</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span><br /></span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>def web_search(query):</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; # 真实接入搜索 API（如 Tavily/Serper）；此处为示意</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; return f\"关于「{query}」的模拟搜索结果……\"</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span><br /></span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span># 2. ReAct 循环：推理 → 工具调用 → 观察 → 再推理</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>def run_agent(user_query):</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; messages = [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": user_query}]</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span><br /></span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; for step in range(5): &nbsp;# 最大步数护栏</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; resp = client.messages.create(</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; model=\"claude-sonnet-4-5\", max_tokens=2048,</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; messages=messages, tools=tools,</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; )</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; # 检查模型是否请求调用工具</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; tool_call = next((b for b in resp.content if b.type == \"tool_use\"), None)</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; if tool_call is None:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; return resp.content[-1].text &nbsp;# 无工具调用 → 输出最终答案</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span><br /></span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; # 3. 执行工具，把结果回喂给模型（Observation）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; result = web_search(tool_call.input[\"query\"])</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; messages.append({\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": resp.content})</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; messages.append({\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": [</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; {\"type\": \"tool_result\", \"tool_use_id\": tool_call.id, \"content\": result},</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ])</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span><br /></span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; return \"达到最大步数，任务未完成。\"</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span><br /></span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>print(run_agent(\"帮我查一下 Agent 最新的开源框架\"))</span></p></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>五步解析（对照 agent-范式 01 篇）：</span><span>工具定义：JSON Schema 告诉模型「有什么能力、参数是什么」；推理：模型决定「该查一下」并输出 tool_use；行动：你执行工具（这里是 web_search）；观察：把 tool_result 回喂；循环：模型看到结果再推理，直到不调工具直接回答。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><span>💡&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>学习要点：裸骨架 = 一个 while 循环 + 工具回喂</span></strong><span>Agent 的本质不是魔法：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>「模型输出 tool_use → 你执行 → 结果回喂 → 模型再想」</span></strong><span>。框架（Eino/LangGraph）干的是把这个循环工程化（状态、重试、流式、追踪）。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>05</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>三、实战避坑（官方/社区共识）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Token 消耗爆炸</span></strong><span>：单 Agent 一次任务 token ≈ 普通聊天的&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>4 倍</span></strong><span>（每次循环都重发全部消息）——所以要有&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;color:#059669;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;\"><span>max_steps</span></span><span>&nbsp;护栏和上下文管理；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>上下文污染</span></strong><span>：中间结果全塞进 messages，长任务会爆窗口——需要摘要/压缩（agent-系列 03 篇上下文工程）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>工具描述即一切</span></strong><span>：</span><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;color:#059669;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;\"><span>description</span></span><span>&nbsp;写不好，模型就不会用或乱用——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>工具是「说明书」，不是「开关」</span></strong><span>；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>流式 tool_use 拼接</span></strong><span>：流式输出时 tool_use 参数可能分片，要攒齐再执行（与 Eino 踩坑同源）。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>06</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>WHY</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>四、从裸骨架到框架（为什么要用 Eino/LangGraph）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>裸骨架（本篇）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>框架版（01-03 篇）</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>手写循环</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;color:#059669;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;\"><span>react.NewAgent(...)</span></span><section><span>&nbsp;一行</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>手写上下文管理</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>MessageModifier / checkpoint</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>无流式支持</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>StreamReader 原生流式</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>无追踪</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Callback / LangSmith 自动埋点</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>单 Agent 到头</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>ADK 多 Agent + HITL</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>07</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>五、本篇要点（复习卡片）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Agent 定义</span></strong><span>：能自己调工具的 AI；核心 = ReAct 循环。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>五步骨架</span></strong><span>：定义工具 → 模型出 tool_use → 执行 → 结果回喂 → 循环。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>工具描述 = 说明书</span></strong><span>：description 决定模型用不用、用得对不对。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>两大坑</span></strong><span>：token 4 倍成本（要护栏）、上下文污染（要压缩）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>5</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>框架价值</span></strong><span>：把循环工程化——流式、状态、追踪、多 Agent。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>08</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>六、下一篇预告</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>第 05 篇（板块二·通用）：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>多 Agent 团队实战</span></strong><span>——单 Agent 会了，怎么组队：Claude Agent Teams 从零搭「竞品调研系统」（搜索 Agent + 分析 Agent + 汇总 Agent 分工协作），附选型判断（什么时候该多 Agent、token 15 倍代价怎么算）。</span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>09</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>参考资料</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] Anthropic Claude API / Tool Use：</span><span>https://docs.anthropic.com/</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[参考] Claude Agent Teams 实战手册（从零搭多 Agent，社区）</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><em style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span>整理：2026-10-02 月绡凝 · 依据官方 SDK 用法。</span></em></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 0;\"><section style=\"height:1px;background:#E5E7EB;margin-bottom:28px;\"><span><br /></span></section></section></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type></mp-style-type></p>", "archived_at": "2026-10-26T10:31:33+0800"}